    double last_step_time; // time_GetCurrentTime() at the last frame advance (or at opening start). Written by llm_tact_door_anim_start (0x004322b1) and at every advance in llm_tact_door_tick (0x004323ab, 0x004323f6, 0x00432495, 0x004324a6); the next advance is gated on last_step_time + speed vs now (0x0043236f, 0x00432459).
