    int32_t acquire_retry_counter; // SIM1-G4 first slice (2026-08-22). Target-acquire retry throttle: decremented every idle-scan tick (0x00471c0c), divided by 5 with the remainder gating a periodic widen-and-retry (0x00471c2a-0x00471c3d), and refreshed from acquire_retry_seed (+0xe) whenever a fresh target acquire fails (0x00471d7a). Was inside reserved_0x2[20]; split 2026-08-22 (RI-SIM SIM1-G4 first slice).
