    int32_t ammo; // SIM1B (2026-08-12). Current ammo count for this turret slot. llm_strat_bldg_turret_reload_tick only refills it from Weapon[weapon_id].ammo when it reads exactly 0 -- consumed elsewhere (outside this batch) when the turret fires.
